Package: intent-os
Version: 0.1.1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Maintainer: Intent OS contributors <intent-os@local.invalid>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), @ROLE_B_PYTHON_PACKAGE@, python3-fastapi, python3-uvicorn, python3-watchdog, python3-gi, libnotify-bin, gir1.2-ayatanaappindicator3-0.1 | gir1.2-appindicator3-0.1, xdotool, x11-utils
Description: Local Ubuntu activity capture and deterministic intelligence for Intent OS
 Captures consented desktop, Firefox, VS Code, and shell metadata locally and
 derives deterministic local intent trees from it. It provides Role A and Role B
 loopback APIs, bounded resume data, restore controls, notifications, and a tray helper.
